  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COUNCIL OF EUROPE CONTACT GROUP ON BELARUS 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Funding for Counil of Europe Contact Group on Belarus which brings together Council Secretariat and representatives of Belarussian civil society and democratic political forces to work on an action plan to support civil society and democracy representatives working towards a future free and democratic Belarus. Specific activities include human rights training, workshops on the European Convention on Human Rights, and study visits to bring Belarussian lawyers to the CoE headquarters.</narrative>
  </description>
